OL,3,GNEWSAFish firm fined #245,000 for
OL,4,Asafety breach after worker pulled into
OL,5,Amachine
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn investigation by the Health and
OL,8,FSafety Executive into the incident in
OL,9,FAugust last year found a safety guard
OL,10,Fhad been removed during maintenance two
OL,11,Fweeks earlier and was not replaced.
